contour (0.6.1.7494-1deepin4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add libfmt-dev to Build-Depends and fix patch file trailing newline.
  * Switch to clang++-17 with libc++-17-dev. GCC 12's libstdc++ does not
    include C++20 \u003cformat\u003e; libc++-17 provides it for clang.
  * Add patch to replace C++20 std::format with fmt::format for GCC 12
    compatibility. Revert clang-17 switch; use g++-12 with libfmt-dev
    instead.

 -- lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>  Thu, 23 Apr 2026 11:34:34 +0800

